  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 (stable): numbers and dates as Report Viewer formats them, .NET Framework's rounding and Windows' culture data, in expressions and custom code too (=0.1+0.2 reads 0.3, a US negative amount ($1,234.50)); maps draw their embedded shapes and a dataset's spatial values; large reports render faster (100,000 rows: 6.7 s instead of 9); the assemblies are obfuscated (up to 1.0.7 the package carried plain ones), each release checked against the plain build report by report. Details: https://ssrs2.net",
